BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sleepaway Camp: The Midnight Mass Experience (1983)
DTSTART:20260625T020000Z
DTEND:20260625T041500Z
DTSTAMP:20260625T020000Z
UID:LCJ0bNw1Nl
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 120 mins (2h00m)\n\nPeaches Christ Productions\, AGF
 A\, & Fangoria present: Sleepaway Camp: The Midnight Mass Experience Abo
 ut the Event: Join Peaches Christ\, original star\, "Angela" herself Felis
 sa Rose\, and Midnight Mass co-host Michael Varrati for a one-night-only c
 elebration of the cult horror classic Sleepaway Camp. The evening begins w
 ith a wildly entertaining live show featuring an opening drag performance\
 , a live onstage conversation with Felissa\, Michael\, and Peaches\, follo
 wed by an ’80s Camp Costume Contest with audience participation. After t
 he live show\, settle in for a screening of Sleepaway Camp on the big scre
 en!VIP ticket holders will be invited to a special meet-and-greet with Fel
 issa Rose\, Peaches Christ\, and Michael Varrati at the start of the film 
 screening\, including a photo opportunity and autographs (up to two items 
 per guest). Whether you’re a longtime fan or a first-time camper\, this 
 is a unique chance to experience Sleepaway Camp like never before.\n\nhttp
 s://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/sleepaway-camp\n\nEstimated start: 19:
 15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
